IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa17-helpers`
IMPORT `coa17-part21a-ch2-others`

-- coa17-tests-part21a-ch2-others.l4: tests for ss 790G-790L (coa17-part21a-ch2-others.l4). Expected values are written by hand
-- from the text of the section named beside each group.

§ `Tests: Part 21A Chapter 2, duties on others, exemption, required particulars`

-- ---- s 790G ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- (1) applies if (a) the person knows, (b) the public register does not indicate their status, (c) they have not informed the company or not given all the particulars
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(1) this section applies to the person` NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790G(2) the person must inform the company of their status and give the company the required particulars` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790G(2) the person must inform the company of their status and give the company the required particulars` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(2) the person must inform the company of their status and give the company the required particulars` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) before the end of the period of one month beginning with the day the conditions are met: 5 January gives 4 February
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the last day for the person to comply with the duty in subsection (2)` (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 4 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the last day for the person to comply with the duty in subsection (2)` (Date 31 1 2026) EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 4 2 2026)) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 5 2 2026)) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 5 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 4 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790G(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 5 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 5 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 790H ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790H(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790H(2) the person must inform the company of the change and give the company the information` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790H(2) the person must inform the company of the change and give the company the information` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790H(3) the last day for the person to comply with the duty in subsection (2)` (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS Date 14 4 2026
#ASSERT `s 790H(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 15 3 2026) (JUST (Date 14 4 2026)) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790H(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 15 3 2026) (JUST (Date 15 4 2026)) (Date 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 790HA -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(1) this section applies to the person` NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790HA(2) the person must inform the company that the person has ceased and of the date on which the person so ceased` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790HA(2) the person must inform the company that the person has ceased and of the date on which the person so ceased` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790HA(3) the last day for the person to comply with the duty in subsection (2)` (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 4 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 790HA(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` (Date 5 1 2026) (JUST (Date 5 2 2026)) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 790I ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790I Schedule 1B contains provisions for the person's failure` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790I Schedule 1B contains provisions for the person's failure` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790I Schedule 1B contains provisions for the person's failure` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- s 790J ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790J(1) the Secretary of State may exempt the person under this section` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(1) the Secretary of State may exempt the person under this section` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(a) the person is not required to comply with a notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(a) the person is not required to comply with a notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(a) the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent the notice` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(a) the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent the notice` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(a) the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent the notice` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(b) companies are not obliged to take steps or give notice under sections 790D, 790E and 790EA to or with respect to the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(b) companies are not obliged to take steps or give notice under sections 790D, 790E and 790EA to or with respect to the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(c) notices under section 790DA do not require anyone else to give any information about the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(c) notices under section 790DA do not require anyone else to give any information about the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(d) the duties imposed by sections 790G, 790H and 790HA do not apply to the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(d) the duties imposed by sections 790G, 790H and 790HA do not apply to the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(e) the person does not count as a registrable person or registrable relevant legal entity for the purposes of sections 12A, 790LA, 790LC, 790LD, 790LE, 790LF, 790LG, 790LH and 790LM to 790LS` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790J(2)(e) the person does not count as a registrable person or registrable relevant legal entity for the purposes of sections 12A, 790LA, 790LC, 790LD, 790LE, 790LF, 790LG, 790LH and 790LM to 790LS` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) must not grant unless satisfied there are special reasons
#ASSERT `s 790J(3) the Secretary of State is barred from granting the exemption` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790J(3) the Secretary of State is barred from granting the exemption` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- ---- s 790K ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- (1): eight particulars (a) to (h); (i) is blank in this text
#ASSERT count (`s 790K(1) the required particulars of an individual who is a registrable person`) EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(a) name` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(b) a service address` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(c) the country or state (or part of the United Kingdom) in which the individual is usually resident` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(d) nationality` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(e) date of birth` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(f) usual residential address` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(g) the date on which the individual became a registrable person in relation to the company in question` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(1)(h) the nature of his or her control over that company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a particular of s 790K(2) or (3) that (1) does not list (principal office) is not one of an individual's
#ASSERT `s 790K(1) the particular is a required particular of an individual who is a registrable person` `s 790K(2)(b) principal office` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2): six particulars; (3): seven particulars
#ASSERT count (`s 790K(2) the required particulars of a person in relation to which this Part has effect as if the person were an individual`) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `s 790K(2) the particular is a required particular of a person in relation to which this Part has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790K(2)(b) principal office` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(2) the particular is a required particular of a person in relation to which this Part has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790K(2)(ba) a service address` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(2) the particular is a required particular of a person in relation to which this Part has effect as if the person were an individual` `s 790K(1)(e) date of birth` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT count (`s 790K(3) the required particulars of a registrable relevant legal entity`) EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `s 790K(3) the particular is a required particular of a registrable relevant legal entity` `s 790K(3)(a) corporate or firm name` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(3) the particular is a required particular of a registrable relevant legal entity` `s 790K(3)(d) if applicable, the register of companies in which it is entered (including details of the state) and its registration number in that register` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(3) the particular is a required particular of a registrable relevant legal entity` `s 790K(3)(f) the nature of its control over that company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(3) the particular is a required particular of a registrable relevant legal entity` `s 790K(1)(d) nationality` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790K(4) the name of the individual` "Jane" "Doe" EQUALS "Jane Doe"
-- (4A) a peer or an individual usually known by a title may give the title instead
#ASSERT `s 790K(4A) the requirement to provide the individual's name may be satisfied by providing the title instead of the forename and surname` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(4A) the requirement to provide the individual's name may be satisfied by providing the title instead of the forename and surname` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790K(4A) the requirement to provide the individual's name may be satisfied by providing the title instead of the forename and surname` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
